<title>USA: Natural Wonders same store sales drop.</title>
<headline>Natural Wonders same store sales drop.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natural Wonders Inc reported sales for the four and 43 week periods ended November 30.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$15.0	$16.4	-8.8	-12.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date     $85.7	$85.5	+0.3	 -2.1</p>
<p>The company said November sales comparisons were significantly negatively impacted by a one-week shift in the retail calendar and a late Thanksgiving this year versus last year.   -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
